Modifications: the lexer, parser, validation, binding and interpretation
rules of @dbml/parse (TypeScript) were ported to Go and restructured; the
table-partial merge of @dbml/core was ported to Go (model/partials.go).
The @dbml/core model structure, the MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQL Server and DBML
exporters (export/), the semantics of the MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQL Server ANTLR
AST generators and of the schema.rb PEG grammar (importer/) were re-implemented
in Go. Ported files carry a header naming their original source paths.

testdata/holistics/ contains test fixtures copied verbatim from the same
repository (see testdata/holistics/NOTICE). testdata/reference/ contains
inputs derived from that repository's fixtures, tests and documentation,
paired with output generated by @dbml/parse 10.3.1. testdata/export/ and
testdata/import/ contain output generated by @dbml/core 10.3.1 from those
inputs and fixtures.

